    "body": "It looks like the same thing can be achieved with this:\r\n```rust\r\nlet in_nix_shell = env::var(\"IN_NIX_SHELL\").ok()?;\r\nmodule.create_segment(\"symbol\", &config.symbol);\r\n```\r\n\r\nAt the `?`, if `$IN_NIX_SHELL` does not exist, the module will return `None`, so you won't need to make the `in_nix_shell.is_ok()` check.",
